# Furucombo Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Furucombo.

Furucombo is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a DeFi and token infrastructure security reference covering token, vesting, rCOMBO and Trevi related contracts.

## Audit Information

Project: Furucombo  
Audit type: DeFi, token, vesting and reward related smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

