## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed DeFi smart contract security work across multiple Furucombo related modules.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s smart contract audit work connected to DeFi infrastructure, token contracts, vesting logic and reward related systems.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
